Headline:
In payments, the platform acts as a real-time operational intelligence engine
Content:
Handles millions of transactions/day
Enables:
Instant failure diagnosis
Gateway-level insights
Region-wise breakdown
Example Query:
“Why did success rate drop today?”
Impact:
Faster incident response
Reduced downtime
Improved transaction success rate
Slide 9 — Industry Application: Banking
Headline:
In banking, the platform serves as a governed decision-support system
Content:
Use cases:
Fraud detection
Loan performance analysis
Customer insights
Key strengths:
