Headline:
The platform reduces analytics turnaround time from days to seconds
Content:
Metric	Current	With Platform
Query resolution time	5–7 days	< 60 seconds
Analyst dependency	High	Low
Decision speed	Slow	Real-time
Coverage	Limited	~70% queries automated
