Headline:
Unlike BI tools, the platform delivers autonomous, context-aware analytics
Content:
Feature	Traditional BI	Proposed System
Interface	Dashboard	Natural language
Analysis	Static	Dynamic
Insight	User-driven	AI-generated
Governance	Partial	Built-in
Speed	Slow	Instant
